card    Basic-Bridge
dealer  S
N K75.KQT4.76.Q964      | 1NT 2D | X   | negative: four hearts, 10 HCP (BBA)
N 53.KJ942.9874.T2      | 1NT 2D | 2H  | five hearts, 4 HCP: to play
N J8.T432.A743.AT7      | 1NT 2H | P   | 9 HCP, no stopper in hearts: pass
N K96.A854.KJ6.832      | 1NT 2H | 3NT | 11 HCP, no four spades: game (BBA)
N AJ92.KQ.J95.K654      | 1NT 2H | X   | negative: four spades
N 4.A742.K97.AT643      | 1NT 2S | X   | negative: four hearts (BBA)
N T3.AQT86.KJ7.QT6      | 1NT 2S | 3H  | five hearts and 12: forcing (BBA)
N Q42.A76.J765.T92      | 1NT 2H | P   | 7 HCP: nothing to say
