N Q74.K7.AT62.K762      | 1NT 3H          | 3NT | 12 with a heart stopper: game
N K74.7.AT62.KJ762      | 1NT 3H          | X   | 11, no stopper, short hearts: takeout
S AQ5.KJ83.KQ2.Q64      | 1NT 3H X P      | P   | four hearts: defends
S AQ5.K8.KQ32.Q642      | 1NT 3H X P      | 3NT | a heart stopper, no four-card major

# ── Their conventional overcalls (2026-09-28): 21GF-DEFAULT plays
