dealer  S
N KQ3.K82.A974.Q65      | 1NT 2D          | 3NT | 14, both majors held: game
N KQ3.J82.A974.Q65      | 1NT 2D          | X   | 12, no heart stopper: values
N 954.K82.Q8743.J5      | 1NT 2D          | P   | 6: nothing to say
