S AQ3.K98.AJ52.K94      | 1NT 2D X 2H     | P   | three hearts: leave it to partner
N AJ92.KQ.J95.K654      | 1NT 2H          | X   | Cappelletti 2♥ has five hearts: negative double as over a natural 2♥
N 954.K82.Q873.AJ5      | 1NT 2NT         | 3NT | 10 HCP: game
N KQJ85.K82.Q87.54      | 1NT 2NT         | 3S  | five spades, 11: forcing
N 954.K82.Q873.J54      | 1NT 2NT         | P   | 6: nothing to say
